## Agregar Administrativo 

POST http://localhost:8088/administrativo HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "run":"214555535-7",
  "nombreAdministrativo":"viviana admin",
  "rol_id_rol":2
}




### Entregar Administrativo
GET  http://localhost:8088/administrativo HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### Obtener Administrativo segun id 
GET http://localhost:8088/administrativo/214555535-7 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### Actualizar Administrativo
PUT http://localhost:8088/administrativo/214555535-7 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "run":"88888-7",
  "nombreAdministrativo":"pepe admin",
  "rol_id_rol":4
}


### Eliminar Administrativo
DELETE http://localhost:8088/administrativo/88888-7 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

